---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Triquetra from '../components/geometry/Triquetra.astro';
---
<Base title="About — CoSine" description="The person behind CoSine.">
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-10">
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl tracking-tight">About</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 measure space-y-5">
    <p>
      I'm Emile Harel. Self-taught developer — manual labour → backend → AI R&D
      in five years. CoSine is where I help people build software they understand.
      The thing I'm best at isn't writing code. It's teaching people to teach
      themselves, so the software they ship gets safer with every iteration.
    </p>
    <p>
      Day job: AI Platform Engineer at Capitec. I build and run the memory and
      tooling that has to survive real users at real scale. CoSine is where I
      bring that same discipline to people now building their own software —
      business owners, small teams, solo founders.
    </p>
    <p>
      South African, currently in Austria.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4">Right now</h2>
    <ul class="measure space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
      <li>Helping people define what they need and build the software that delivers it.</li>
      <li>Hardening a memory layer used in production at a tech-driven bank.</li>
      <li>Shipping Sosine — the first sibling in the CoSine product family.</li>
      <li>Music. Climbing. Running. Family.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mb-4">Threads</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 measure">
      <p><strong class="font-display">Curiosity.</strong> I read schemas before I read marketing. The interesting question is always the one underneath.</p>
      <p><strong class="font-display">Ideas to life.</strong> A diagram is a hypothesis. The shipped system is the answer.</p>
      <p><strong class="font-display">Off-screen.</strong> The success metric is what happens when the screen is dark.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="flex justify-center py-12">
    <Triquetra size={80} />
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <p class="mono">
      <a href="mailto:hello@cosinehq.co.za">hello@cosinehq.co.za</a>
      <span class="mx-3" style="color: var(--ink-soft);">·</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/RiotTheMan">github</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
